					"**Une part.** ${{eval:a*x}} \\div {{a}} = \\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{x}}}$.\n\n```schema-barres\n: {{x}} ; {{x}}{{if:a>2| ; {{x}}|}}{{if:a>3| ; {{x}}|}}{{if:a>4| ; {{x}}|}}{{if:a>5| ; {{x}}|}} ; {{b}} = {{eval:a*x+b}} billes\n```\n\n"
